// Xtensa's va_list is { stack, saved argument registers, byte index }. Every
// scanf result argument is a pointer, so the general va_arg operation reduces
// to this four-byte case. Keeping the state in Abla-owned stack storage lets
// LLVM see and fold the ABI bookkeeping together with the format parser.
